WEBVTT

00:00:00.293 --> 00:00:04.913
More — Approvals, your assignments, your profile and settings.

00:00:08.002 --> 00:00:12.604
More has everything else, grouped: WorkDesk, the rest of the Employee Portal, and settings.

00:00:13.237 --> 00:00:16.241
Approvals — the number is how many requests wait for you.

00:00:18.706 --> 00:00:25.709
Swipe the filter row sideways for each type. Each card has the numbers you need, and the four actions: Approve, Edit &amp; approve, Decline, Request info.

00:00:28.217 --> 00:00:31.420
My assignments and allowances: how many hours you have left on each project.

00:00:33.882 --> 00:00:37.889
Running low? Request hours asks your manager for more.

00:00:40.413 --> 00:00:44.417
My profile: your role, team, manager and contract — and Edit my details, and Sign out.

00:00:50.515 --> 00:00:55.022
The Employee Portal group opens your tasks, the Library, the Knowledge Base and this Handbook.

00:00:56.585 --> 00:01:01.587
Language, and the desktop layout — for the Dashboard and Management, best on a bigger screen.

00:01:02.304 --> 00:01:06.408
Everything else, one tap away — More help: the Handbook → Finding your way around.
